{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09031","headline":"善福阁对雨寄李儋幼遐 · 韦应物","name":"善福阁对雨寄李儋幼遐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞阁凌太虚，晨跻郁峥嵘。\n惊飙触悬槛，白云冒层甍。\n太阴布其地，密雨垂八紘。\n仰观固不测，俯视但冥冥。\n感此穷秋气，沈郁命友生。\n及时未高步，羇旅游帝京。\n圣朝无隐才，品物俱昭形。\n国士秉绳墨，何以表坚贞。\n寸心东北驰，思与一会幷。\n我车夙已驾，将逐晨风征。\n郊涂住成淹，默默阻中情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}